  npcName: Mimo
  npcPortrait: {fileID: -2248930328496868200, guid: e2daa49a030084ade9dffd744df42adf, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - Hello, my name is Mimo. Nice to meet you!
  - I have been living in this village since ages. You don't look like you are from here.
  - We all survive on dry food, but it doesn't grow on trees.
  - Just earlier today, I helped someone with their grocery shopping, and I earned a nice bowl of food!
